Define struct Pair of T and U with first as T and second as U.
Define function swap_pair of T and U taking p as Pair<T, U> returning Pair<U, T>:
    r is Pair<U, T>.
    Set r.first to p.second.
    Set r.second to p.first.
    Return r.
p is Pair<i64, f64>.
Set p.first to 4.
Set p.second to 2.5.
q is swap_pair(p).
Return (q.first as i64) + q.second.
